- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/staff-domain/severe-disability-addition
  route: staff-domain/severe-disability-addition
  key: severe-disability-addition
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:BenefitComponent
  label: Pension Credit severe-disability additional amount
  definition: Navigation to the Pension Credit additional amount for people who are severely disabled.
    The captured guidance identifies separate no-partner and partner branches in DMG 78034 and 78045.
    The permanent-care-home paragraph 78088 is headed Claimants who have no partner (including self-funders)
    and requires all its conditions to be satisfied. This additional amount is distinct from the Severe
    Disablement Allowance benefit described in DMG 57001. This overview does not set out the full qualifying
    conditions or a consolidated current-law rule.
  aliases:
  - label: SDA
    case_sensitive: true
  - severe disability additional amount
  source_candidates:
  - source-c027
  - source-c028
  review_status: unreviewed-specialist-review-required
