  route: term/intl-spc-absence-transition-2016
  key: intl-spc-absence-transition-2016
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:DecisionRule
  label: The stated 28 July 2016 SPC absence transition
  definition: DMG 077015 states that a person already temporarily absent on 28 July 2016 remains
    subject to the previous regulations until return to Great Britain; further absences use the new
    rules. This is a dated source-described transition, not a finding that it applies to the question
    or a claim that the captured guidance is current law. The relevant absence date and
    previous-regulation provisions remain to be established.
