- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/staff-domain/income-support
  route: staff-domain/income-support
  key: income-support
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:Benefit
  label: Income Support
  definition: Income Support has its own conditions of entitlement, distinguished from JSA in DMG 20002 and
    listed in DMG 20022. The captured rules include prescribed-category, age, work, income and partner
    conditions and an explicit mixed-age exception in Note 2. They are legacy guidance, not proof of current
    availability for a new claim. Prisoner applicable-amount rules are one circumstance-specific branch, not
    the definition of Income Support.
  aliases:
